-- Fixture Room · test seed (23 Sep 2026). Fixed ids, idempotent, and meant to
-- run INSIDE the caller's transaction: every smoke file inlines this block
-- after its BEGIN (scripts/fixture-room-harness.sh assembles the files from
-- this seed and the bodies under supabase/tests/fixture_room/bodies, so the
-- copies cannot drift); fixture_race_two_sessions.sh runs it in a committed
-- transaction and removes the rows afterwards.
--
-- Gates and triggers are skipped while the listings are inserted (these are
-- test rows, not member submissions); check constraints still apply. The
-- role is reset to origin before any Fixture Room RPC runs, so the
-- append-only triggers are live for the assertions.
--
-- Shape:  two member organisations (charterer with two seats, owner with one
-- active and one pending seat), an outsider organisation, a platform admin,
-- an individual member with no organisation, a T1 member, a contact-backed
-- listing, a listing owned by an admin (platform-synced), a sanctioned vessel
-- and a TBN vessel. Every counterparty case of amendment A1 is reachable.
